The installation index and wiring map make these responsibilities discoverable; essential methods stay inside each skill bundle rather than requiring sibling identities. Native inspection, established repository checks where relevant and existing worker execution are sufficient; neither a custom link checker nor a new MCP is required for these methods.

== Source authority is a content question

A reachable document can contain superseded instructions, and a current-looking file can conflict with approved intent. Verify the relevant content, governing decision, affected scope and actual consumer rather than substituting a link count for that judgment.

Native inspection or an established repository check can confirm a specific routing defect when one matters. That is supporting hygiene, not proof of semantic freshness, source authority or intent fidelity; create no custom tool without a demonstrated unmet need.

The useful evidence is the located conflict, its authority and status, the behavior it would change and the exact unresolved decision. Unavailable required sources remain unverified; a mechanical success must not hide that gap.

== Evaluate the reviewer as well as delivery

Reviewer changes and any proposed reliance increase need representative known-defective and known-clean cases with independent grading. Keep original criteria and available capabilities fixed; hold expected judgments back from the reviewer, and disclose any exposure to gold labels, earlier answers or author narratives.

Compare consequential misses, false acceptance, invented harmful changes to clean cases, unnecessary blocking and actual effort. Reusing public synthetic cases is not secure holdout testing; confirmed private incidents need permission and suitable storage, not automatic capture into a shared corpus.

Synthetic cases can exercise the review method, but they do not establish field accuracy. If the prior method already handles a case correctly, that case cannot demonstrate an improvement; repeated exercises also have context/order confounders.

== What remains to prove

*Artifact checks* can establish that current source routes resolve and this PDF is built from current sources. They cannot establish that every future agent will follow policy or that a real owner will spend less time repairing misunderstandings.

*One-capability pilot* should measure total owner review plus repair time, early intent-mismatch detection, post-handoff rework/escaped failures and reviewer noise. Select a distinguishing probe from that task's approved acceptance criteria, and record its expected result before execution; this guide supplies no application-specific test result.

Keep real mandatory gates and human decisions intact while gathering evidence. After one or two deliveries, retain, revise or remove additions based on actual benefit, false alarms and misses; do not equate report count, code volume, reviewer agreement or synthetic success with trust.
